<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1114022003">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<attention1>
<ptxt>
If you do not select a suitable route and take proper precautions when performing a road test, an accident can occur.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Select a level road with no traffic to minimize the risk of accident.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the test extremely carefully.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the road test with 2 persons, a driver and a tester.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention1>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that the following conditions are met in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
A/F feedback (closed loop) control is activated.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Battery voltage &#62; 11 V
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that the following DTCs are not detected in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-1 heater (P0030, P0031 and P0032)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-2 (P0137, P0138 and P0140)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Fuel injector (P0201, P0202, P0203, P0204, P0261, P0262, P0264, P0265, P0267, P0268, P0270 and P0271)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine to normal operating temperature.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drive vehicle at 60 to 80 km/h (37 to 50 mile/h) constantly for 10 min. or more.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Release accelerator pedal, and keep vehicle coasting for 15 sec. with engine brakes applied (fuel cut condition).
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1114022004">
<title>
DTC Troubleshooting
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLJA0A1114022005">
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1114022006">
<question>
Was “Engine and Emission Control System Check” performed?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1114001">Engine and Emission Control System Check:K12M</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1114022007">
<title>
DTC check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check DTC.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is there DTC(s) detected other than P0130?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to troubleshooting for applicable DTC.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 3.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1114022008">
<title>
HO2S-1 heater, HO2S-1 circuit and HO2S-1 heater circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-1 heater: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1316014"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-1 circuit: Step 3 under 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1114023">DTC P0131 / P0132:K12M</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-1 heater circuit: Step 2 – 3 under 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1114015">DTC P0030 / P0031 / P0032:K12M</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 4.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective parts.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1114022009">
<title>
HO2S-2 heater, HO2S-2 circuit and HO2S-2 heater circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-2 heater: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1316014"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-2 circuit: Step 3 under 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1114026">DTC P0137 / P0138 / P0140:K12M</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S-2 heater circuit: Step 2 – 3 under 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1114016">DTC P0036 / P0037 / P0038:K12M</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 5.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective parts.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1114022010">
<title>
DTC recheck
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Replace HO2S-1. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1316015"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Perform “DTC Confirmation Procedure”, and check DTC.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is DTC P0130 still detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 6.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
End.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1114022011">
<title>
DTC recheck
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Replace HO2S-2. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1316015"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Perform “DTC Confirmation Procedure”, and check DTC.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is DTC P0130 still detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace ECM and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1316001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
End.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
</servinfosub>
